        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-[#fcfaf6] mb-4 leading-tight">長輩夜裡不睡、日夜顛倒怎麼辦？高雄居家看護的夜間照顧與家屬輪替安排</h1>
        <div class="flex items-center text-[#efe5d5] text-sm space-x-4">
          <span>2026-08-05</span><span>11 分鐘閱讀</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

